                            <Shape Type="Text" CutIndex="15" Font="Arial,-1,4096,5,400,0,0,0,0,0" Str="The diameter of the outer circle of the rear baseplate should be exactly 427mm in your cutting program by default.&#10;If not, double check and scale all pieces according to the provided dimensions in the key.&#10;The ensures everything is scaled properly&#10;&#10;&quot;Note: Dimensions shown are precise for laser cutting or CNC machines.&#10;Hand-cut builders may round to nearest millimeter (e.g., 326.939mm ≈ 327mm).&quot;&#10;&#10;Please use 6mm (1/4&quot;) MDF wood as this will make the thickness of your completed drum similar&#10;to the Arcade version, this will also providecthe proper structural integrity to  last a long time." H="22.5" LS="0" LnS="0" Ah="1" Av="1" Weld="1" HasBackupPath="1">
